Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嘿  -嗯  好啦  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hey.  - Yeah. Yeah, okay. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能不能谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, can we talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚这里的发生的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what happened here last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行  先给我几秒钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Just give me a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我进入你那愤怒又诡异的状态\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to get all huffy and weird like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢相信某某人在昨天晚在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You believe that whoever did something last night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了某某事要么没做某某事  有没有搞错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}did what they did or didn't do? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真不了解我说的是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you really don't know what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不知道  -好  昨天晚上的派对之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- No.  - Okay. Last night, after the party...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到瑞秋在你家的阳台上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw Rachel kissing that jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲她那个混蛋同事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from her office out on your balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我家阳台  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our balcony? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可好玩了  我就和莫妮卡说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so funny. I told Monica
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该在阳台上加个灯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we should put lights on our balcony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.41,0:00:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可她说不用  外面那么冷  没人会去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and she said, ''No, no. It's too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody will go out there.'' And I said:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们加个灯或许就有人会去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Maybe if we put some lights out there they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.95,0:00:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我过来就是要和你谈这事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right, that's what I came over to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到瑞秋在你家阳台上亲了一个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw Rachel kissing some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然那里连灯都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}on your balcony, even though there were no lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你要跟她谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So are you gonna talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么我要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她要找寻新生活  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, if she wants to move on, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说没关系  真有说服力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know when ''that's fine'' sounds true?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喷着口水用力吼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When someone yells it and spits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我认真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她想要跟别人约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, if she wants to date people,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}fine. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是至少她要跟我说啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But at least she could have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经完全不顾个人生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I've been putting my life on hold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,集中全部精力在艾玛身上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and concentrating on Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果她想要出去随便亲男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if she wants to go out there kissing guys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我也要去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she barely knows, then so will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑  罗斯是同志\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very funny! Ross is gay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没  很好  所以你也要有新的生活了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. Good, so you're moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备怎么过新生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have any idea where you're moving on to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我机会多的很呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got plenty of opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就刚刚在咖啡厅里  有个女人对我笑呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just now, there was some woman at the coffeehouse smiled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一天在地铁  有个女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then the other day on the subway, a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不小心  坐到我的手上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''accidentally'' sat on my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  别跟我炫耀你疯狂的单身生活了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, don't rub my face in your crazy single life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  在学校有个人类学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And there's an anthropologist at school who totally came on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跨部门餐会的时候 不停勾搭我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}during the interdepartmental potluck dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要结婚啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why did I get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第13集  莫妮卡唱歌记\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E13 The One Where Monica Sings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问你们一个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, let me ask you guys something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明天要拍新艺术照\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm having new headshots taken tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摄影师说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The photographer said she thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该修修眉毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should have my eyebrows waxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:02:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男生修眉会不会很怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that weird for a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  那要看情况  -什么情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Well, it depends.  - On?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他的变性手术做到哪个阶段了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On how far along he is in the sex-change process.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我完全不同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I totally disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得男生那样做没有什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's fine for a guy to do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Especially an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说你有那个必要  你的眉毛…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, not that you need to. Your eyebrows are....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们别这样  别盯着我看  吓着我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it, you guys. Stop staring, you're freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你手指头也毛茸茸的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your knuckles are kind of hairy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  现在我还要除这些毛吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man, now I have to get those done too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你要做的改造可不少啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, talk about high maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还不是染发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You dye your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.41,0:03:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我是女人啊  -双重标准\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I'm a woman.  - Double standards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差点忘记 你今晚去迈克的钢琴酒吧吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before I forget, are you coming to Mike's piano bar tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要不让我上台唱歌就去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Only if I don't have to get up and sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是大家都要唱歌啊  很好玩的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But everybody sings. It's so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次有个可爱的老先生上台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Last time, this adorable old man got up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,歌词全忘了  糗呆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}forgot all the words, flipped out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后大家就嘘他下台  太好玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and everyone booed him off the stage. It was so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是很会唱歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm not good at singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦  你害怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what's the matter? You scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:03:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怕我唱的比你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You afraid I'm a better singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怕我会用歌声把你打得落花流水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You afraid I'm gonna beat you at singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  这招对我没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nope. Nope. It's not working on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  我一定是长大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I must be growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  就过来支持迈克就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine. Just please come and support Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要唱歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't have to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我又不用唱歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I don't have to sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还可以坐在那里评论别人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I can just sit there and pass judgment on others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还可以一边喝酒  -我要去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- While drinking.  - I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好 我需要你们的帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, you guys. Listen, I really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我做了一件很蠢的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I did something really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  瑞秋  但至少结果还是很漂亮的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yes, Rachel, but you got something so beautiful out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是那件事  我昨晚亲了盖文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, not that. I kissed Gavin last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我的天  -你亲了他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- My God.  -You kissed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  就在派对结束之后 我们在阳台上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it was after the party, we were on the balcony
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我一直都在家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait, wait. I was at home the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did I miss that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派对才刚结束 你可能正忙着烫平包装纸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it was the end of the party. You were probably ironing wrapping paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们怎么会亲起来的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how did you end up kissing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们单独在一起  然后他又很体贴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were all alone and he was being really nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后又送我这条围巾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he gave me this scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你讨厌他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来爱与恨之间只有一线之隔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there is a thin line between love and hate...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而结果  那条线就是这围巾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it turns out that line is a scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要跟这男的交往吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you thinking of starting something up with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  太复杂了  我和他一起工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. lt's so complicated. I work with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有小孩  还有罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have the baby, and I have Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我再十分钟就要进办公室见到盖文了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have to be at the office and see Gavin in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来你应该想想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds like you need to think about
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么跟盖文说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what you want and talk to Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你一定得要跟罗斯谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you definitely should talk to Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以打电话请病假  那就都不用管了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I could call in sick and not deal with it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请了五个月的产假  才回去上了四天班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! Five months maternity leave, you're back for four days...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲了一个同事  又要请病假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}kiss a co-worker and call in sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有你这个员工真幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They are lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗨  -嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hi.  - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我预约了修眉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm here for my eyebrow appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么姓名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德勒·宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请先坐一下  宾先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have a seat right here, Mr. Bing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桑妮亚很快就过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and Sonya will be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我碰了下那玩意儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I touched the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来处理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来你们… 你们这里的男生多吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So do you...? Do you get a lot of guys in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-当然  -太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Oh, absolutely.  - Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想认识认识吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You looking to meet somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, let's just do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我们等一下再上热蜡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, we'll get to the wax in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先我要先拔一些杂毛  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First, I want to tweeze some of the strays, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能会有点痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, this may sting just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你随意  我可是一点都不怕痛的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, I have an extremely high threshold
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈咪啊   喔  我的脸  我的脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Holy Mother of God! Oh, my face! My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  我没事  我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm all right. I'm all right. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是有点吓到  没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just a bit of shock, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-但是我没事  你可以继续了 -好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- But I'll be fine. You can go again.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:07:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶  你这女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全纽约最适合结婚的单身汉来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the most eligible man in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新生活进行得如何呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How's the moving on going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太好  地铁上又有个人坐到我的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not well. I went on the subway again and someone did sit on my hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个人既不是女性 也没有穿内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but that person was neither female nor wearing pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你完全错估情势了  我是说你想想看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you're going about this the wrong way. I mean, think about it:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,单身白种男性  离婚三次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Single white male, divorced three times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有两个非婚生子女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}two illegitimate children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该要自己心里有数的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The personal ad writes itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是好笑  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that's funny. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你觉得你这辈子会找到工作吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So do you think you'll ever work again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛   你知道我们会斗个没完的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? You know I can only dish it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信瑞秋就这样抛下过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe Rachel just moved on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还什么都没有跟我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and didn't say anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许她并没有抛下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe she didn't move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许那只是冲动之下吻的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that kiss was just an impulsive,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过生日才发生一次的那种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}one-time birthday thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  一个月以前  她还把电话号码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, a month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留给一个在酒吧认识的男的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she gave her number to some guy in a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有跟他出去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did she go out with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  他打电话来时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. When he called
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把留言扔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I threw the message away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是厉害啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The high road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you know what? Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱怨够了  我要展开新生活了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Enough talking. I have to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧那两个金发美女  跟我一起过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, check out those two blonds over there. Hey, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要害每个人都离婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you trying to get everybody divorced?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是让你真泡妞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们两个一起过去会比较好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'll just be easier if it's two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像大学一样  记得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like college, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先过去说笑话热场面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First, you break the ice with some kind of a joke
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让她们知道你是好玩的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so they know you're the funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我再插入有趣的话题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I swoop in with interesting conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让她们知又道我才是既聪明  有教养还性感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so they'll see that I'm the brilliant, brooding, sexy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为笑话都是我来讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought I got to make the jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用上班吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you have to be at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  我叫钱德勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. Hi, my name's Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我朋友罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is my friend Ross right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们加入\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if you're up for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就只差六个人来玩人体金字塔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we only need six more people for a human pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接手  接手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Swoop. Swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到你在看报纸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I notice you're reading the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧洲又有水灾了  对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Another flood in Europe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问你们个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's a question:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你宁愿被淹死还是被活活烧死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you rather drown or be burned alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-很抱歉  我们要走了  -好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I'm sorry, we're just leaving. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝刀未老\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖文  我带一些汤来给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gavin. I brought you some soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么   -我听说你生病了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Why? - I heard you were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  对  等一下 让我先整理一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right! Hold on, let me just clean up in here a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  盖文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天上班好想你  你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I missed you at work. How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想对你说谎  我病得很重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna lie to you, I'm pretty sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好  因为我还担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. Because I was having a totally paranoid moment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.93,0:11:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在装病逃避我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}where I thought you called in sick to avoid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚很愉快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I had fun last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的病到底传染性有多高呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Exactly how contagious is this thing you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为站在阳台上受凉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it a cold from standing on the balcony,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是被猴子咬了呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or did a monkey bite you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:12:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-只是单纯的感冒  -有发烧吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- It's just a cold.  - Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  怎么了  怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What is it? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那张照片  罗斯在对你做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's Ross doing to you in that picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在用化石刷子帮我除尘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, he's dusting me with a fossil brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得那样很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He thought it would be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Right. Right.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-罗斯  -是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Ross. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们之间有什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the deal with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想当第三者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't wanna get in the middle of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是第三者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not getting in the middle of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry about Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快躲  是罗斯  躲起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hide! That's Ross! Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,躲起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hide! Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你说不用担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but you said not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我撒谎  而且我也没有生病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I lied and I'm not sick either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,躲到窗廉后面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just stay behind the curtain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗨  -是莫莉啊  不是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hi.  - Oh, Molly. You're not Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我来接艾玛到你妈家  记得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I'm here to take Emma to your mother's, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  是的  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-千万别慌  -怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Don't panic.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:13:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个男人藏在你家窗帘后头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There is a man behind your curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我皮包里有防狼喷雾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have Mace in my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  没关系  不用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's okay! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我同事盖文在发神经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is my business associate Gavin being silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  别站那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come out from behind there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我叫盖文  很高兴认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Gavin. Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我要站在那里的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was my idea to stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  我去带艾玛  -好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hello. I'll just go get Emma.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我要躲呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}why did I have to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为那是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought it was Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是又如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what if it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们之间已经没有什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought there was nothing going on between you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是没有  完全没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There isn't. There totally isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到钥匙转动的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You hear keys in the hall
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像斗牛第一次出栏一样跳了起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you jump like a bronco coming out of the chute for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做过牛仔小丑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I used to be a rodeo clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  听着  盖文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Iook, Gavin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是  你在这里让我有罪恶感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I felt guilty that you were here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:14:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯跟我没又有在交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Ross and I are not in a relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是我孩子的父亲  而且我们住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but he is the father of my child. And, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加上  我们有太多过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we do live together. And plus, there's just so much history, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.71,0:14:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是…  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just-- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  脑子很乱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I'm just all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这或许与我无关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's probably not my place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我可以给你一个建议吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but can I give you a piece of advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该跟罗斯谈谈这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you should talk to Ross about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都这样说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People keep saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  盖文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是现在不是好时机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讲真的吗  牛仔小丑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So seriously, rodeo clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,技术最棒的  小姐  技术最棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One of the best, ma'am. One of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有时间留给失败\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"No time for losers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:15:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们是真正的冠军\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'cause we are the champions of the world...!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我女朋友  大家不用这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, she's my girlfriend. That's not just how we do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要休息一下  回来时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna take a little break, and when we come back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.55,0:15:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯尼将要演唱《自摸》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}.we've got Kenneth singing ''I Touch Myself.''
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不做评论了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not here to judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要上台唱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have got to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我告诉过你我不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I told you I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会很喜欢的  而且你的嗓子很好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you would have so much fun. And you have a really nice voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候听过我唱歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When have you heard me sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,常常  当你在煮饭的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All the time, when you're cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -是啊  你总是哼哼着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What?  - Yeah, you're always singing:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃  好吃  好吃 我肚肚里有爱爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yummy, yummy, yummy I've got love in my tummy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那个我还挺拿手的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I do rock that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道一点都不想要上去唱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't there just a little part of you that wants to get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点而已  老天  好可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just a little. But, God, it's so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不知道要唱什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't even know what I would sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我有歌本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I've got a book around
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《德耳塔·道恩》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''Delta Dawn.''
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不注意到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. I couldn't help but notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的项链好特别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but that's an unusual necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一个小时前就来搭讪过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You already hit on me an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  所以确定不行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. So that's a firm no?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信  我一直被判出局\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't believe this. I just keep striking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't get it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  很明显地你是很饥渴了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you're obviously desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你问女人想怎么死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're asking women how they wanna be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  瑞秋继续去亲男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is great. Rachel's gonna keep kissing guys
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到找到她想要的男人 而我将孤单地死去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...until she finds the one she wants, and I'm gonna die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.81,0:16:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是淹死还是…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By drowning or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么要跟我分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would he break up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要的只不过是爱他  希望他也爱我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I ever wanted was to just love him and have him love me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有这么不可爱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, am I so unlovable?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-哇  -我懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Wow. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  以上是肯尼所带来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. That was Kenneth with his
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现场演绎的《自摸》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}much too literal rendition of ''I Touch Myself.''
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是莫妮卡演唱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coming up next, we've got Monica singing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《德耳塔·道恩》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''Delta Dawn.''
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我不能在这些人面前唱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. I can't sing in front of all these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假装他们不在  没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just pretend they're not even here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聚光灯一打到你身上  亮得耀眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Once that spotlight hits you, it's so bright,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看不到任何人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you won't see anyone anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫莫妮卡  我要唱的是《德耳塔·道恩》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm Monica. And l'm going to be singing ''Delta Dawn.''
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德耳塔·道恩  你手上拿的是什么花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Delta Dawn, what's that flower you have on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是随过去岁月褪色的玫瑰...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could it be a faded rose from days gone by? ..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以看穿她的上衣吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you totally see through her shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像X光一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like an x-ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天不穿内衣可倒霉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bad day not to wear a bra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带你一起去他天上的殿堂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"To take you to his mansion in the sky-y?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很严重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, it seems serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么问题了  艾希莉·贾德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What seems to be the problem, Ashley Judd?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去拍艺术照  所以去修了眉毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm getting new headshots taken. So I went to get my eyebrows shaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  求你了  让我笑一会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Moment to make fun of that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来可能有点娘  可还是能揍倒你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I may be a sissy, but I'll still pound you into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:19:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,修眉太痛了  我只能让她拔一边  所以就\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, it hurt so bad, I could only let her do one eyebrow, and now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两边不对称了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}they don't match!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像毛毛虫宝宝在追妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like a baby caterpillar chasing its mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得帮我  好吗   我这有马克笔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got to help me out, okay? Look, I have a magic marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我把细的这边画粗  照出来不会蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fill in the skinny one so I don't look stupid for my pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  但首先这是绿色的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, first of all, this is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈的该怎么办啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I will help you out...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你要答应我  不会把我告诉你的事说出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but you have to promise you won't tell anyone what I'm about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道大部分的小孩都是帮人除草\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how most kids get their allowance
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是倒垃圾什么的来赚取零用钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from mowing the lawn or taking out the garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我赚零用钱的方式就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I earned mine
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我父亲还有他的"生意伙伴"修眉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}by plucking the eyebrows of my father and his ''business partners.''
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你不需要我的帮忙了  乔伊小乔妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, I guess you don't need my help, Victor-Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   我要  我需要你帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. I do. I do. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是钱德勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, Chandler, I don't know if I can
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道能不能再忍受拔毛  真的好痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}take any more plucking. It hurt so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安啦  有我的冰块跟芦荟配方 加上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not with my combination of ice cubes, aloe vera and my gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温柔的连自己也厌恶的手法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}self-loathing touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带你一起去他天上的殿堂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"To take you to his mansion in the sky-y?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.35,0:20:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  可歌唱完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, the song's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有看到我在上面吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you see me up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清清楚楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Every little bit of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信我在大家面前唱歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I sang in front of people
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还喜欢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and they liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有听到还有人大喊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear that guy shouting,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧那些小费吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''Look at those tips''?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}tips:意同乳头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.47,0:20:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有帮你多赚小费吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, did I really help you get a lot of tips?
