Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.62,0:27:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢她吗   我还希望我们可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you not like her? Because I was hoping we could come
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.56,0:27:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去参加你的阳台亲吻派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to your kissing parties on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.65,0:27:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信你竟然这么小题大作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you are making a big deal about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.22,0:27:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是一个吻而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was one kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.63,0:27:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-跟一个人  就这么一次  -真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- One guy. One time! - Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.33,0:27:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真的  -喔  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah. - Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.68,0:27:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.82,0:27:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那个酒吧认识的男的呢  -谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What about the guy from the bar?  - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.67,0:27:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给他电话号码的那一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The guy you gave your number to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.47,0:27:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他打来找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because he called here looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.44,0:27:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以别跟我说  你只是亲了一次男同事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So don't tell me kissing this guy from work is a one-time thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.19,0:27:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你又在酒吧  又在阳台上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you've been out there in bars and on balconies
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.39,0:27:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经一个多月了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for over a month now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都没有礼貌性和我说一声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you don't even have the courtesy to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.44,0:28:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么我没有拿到留言  -什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Why didn't I get that message?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.31,0:28:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个酒吧男的留言  为什么我没有拿到留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From the guy in the bar? Why didn't I get that message?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.31,0:28:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我折起来放到裤子口袋里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I folded it up and put it in my pants pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.76,0:28:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有去找过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you not look there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.08,0:28:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有拿给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.79,0:28:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.27,0:28:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.11,0:28:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你知道吗  我不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, you know what? I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.05,0:28:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你是谁呢  你有什么权利决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who do you think you are? Who are you to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么留言我该收  什么不该收\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what messages I should or should not get?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.99,0:28:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我是谁  -是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Who am I?  -Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.83,0:28:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在你去酒吧认识男人的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the guy who's taking care of our baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.24,0:28:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在家照顾我们的孩子的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}while you're at bars meeting guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.31,0:28:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.40,0:28:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还希望能够跟你  成熟地谈谈我们之间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I actually came in here hoping to have a mature conversation with you about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不能跟会藏我留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I can't do that with someone who hides my messages
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.77,0:28:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还会带疯女人回我公寓的人谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and brings crazy women back to my apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正常的人没有一个要跟我回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, none of the sane ones wanted to come back with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.76,0:29:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是重点好吗  重点是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not the point, okay? The point is
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.06,0:29:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你抛下我们的过去  而你却没有说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you are the one who moved on and didn't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  罗斯  这真是糟透了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, Ross, this is just so messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.53,0:29:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is wrong with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.32,0:29:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家知道我们的情况后  都会问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When people hear about our situation, they ask:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.63,0:29:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们住在一起  还不是夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''You live together, but you're not a couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.71,0:29:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们又有小孩  不是很奇怪吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}yet you have a baby? Isn't that weird?''
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会说  不会  我们都没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I say, ''No. It's not, because it works for us.''
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.26,0:29:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你知道吗  是有问题的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know what? This doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.22,0:29:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  还正好相反咧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}ln fact, this is the opposite of working.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.86,0:29:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确如此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.38,0:29:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.27,0:29:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有说过只要一切没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we said that we would live together
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就会一直住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}as long as this makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.19,0:29:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而  或许一切不再是没问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and maybe this just doesn't make sense anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  或许不再是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你想要怎样呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.64,0:29:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.51,0:29:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟艾玛可以过来住一阵子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can Emma and I live here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-当然可以  -谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Of course.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你眉毛好奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your eyebrows look weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.61,0:30:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶利米书是只牛蛙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Jeremiah was a bullfrog.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.72,0:30:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它曾是我的好友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was a good friend of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的话我不曾听懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}never understood a single word he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.02,0:30:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我帮他喝了他的酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I helped him drink his wine."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.86,0:30:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不管怎样  你都会自摸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you'll just touch yourself for anything, then?
